        {
          "name": "Course lessons",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Save the first lesson's ID so \"Mark a lesson complete\" can use {{lessonId}}.",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.success && body.data.lessons.length > 0) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"lessonId\", body.data.lessons[0]._id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/courses/{{freeCourseId}}/lessons",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "courses",
                "{{freeCourseId}}",
                "lessons"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Purpose: Get a course's full lessons (videos and notes) in order, with my progress.\n\nAccess: A student enrolled in the course, the course's instructor, or an admin. Anyone else gets 403.\n\nBody: none.\n\nParameters (path):\n- `id`: the course's `_id`. This request uses `{{freeCourseId}}`.\n\n`enrollment` is `{ completedLessons, progress }` for a student, and `null` for the course's instructor or an admin.\n\nThis request saves the first lesson's `_id` as `{{lessonId}}`, which Mark a lesson complete uses."
          },
