            "description": "Purpose: Mark a lesson complete and update my progress.\n\nAccess: A student enrolled in the course.\n\nBody: none.\n\nParameters (path):\n- `courseId`: the course's `_id` (`{{freeCourseId}}`)\n- `lessonId`: a lesson in that course (`{{lessonId}}`, saved by Course lessons)\n\n`progress` is round(completed / lessonCount × 100), and `completedAt` is set when it reaches 100. Completing the same lesson again changes nothing."
          },
